{%- comment -%}
  Embedded Cognito Forms form, prefilled with the dealer identifiers the legacy
  b2b-shop sent (return-center + self-repair). Its React pages injected exactly
  these two script tags into the document and rewrote the `Cognito.prefill`
  argument client-side; server-rendering them is the same contract without the
  injection dance — `seamless.js` blocks, so `Cognito` is defined by the time
  the inline call runs.

  Rendered only for a shopper who has a B2B customer number: the legacy pages
  waited for it before injecting the form, so a submission can never carry an
  empty CustomerNumber.

  The form is fetched from cognitoforms.com, so there is a visible gap before it
  paints. The skeleton below stands in during that gap and crossfades to the real
  form (assets/aico-cognito-form.js). Both live in the same grid cell so the swap
  can't shift the page. `seamless.js` injects the form next to its own script
  tag, i.e. inside `.aico-cognito-mount`.

  Accepts:
    form_id        — Cognito form id (theme setting; differs per page).
    skeleton_intro — true on the form that leads with an intro paragraph
                     (self-repair, 228px header vs return-center's 89px).
{%- endcomment -%}

<main class="aico-page-container aico-cognito-form" role="main">
  {%- if customer.aico_customer_number and form_id != blank -%}
    <div class="aico-cognito-embed" data-aico-cognito>
      {%- comment -%}
        Row rhythm measured from the two live forms (both are the same 11-row
        shape; only the intro and the batch-number block differ):
        title 89px · customer-number readout 69 · Partner+E-Mail 2-up 86 ·
        Kontakt 86 · Marke 69 · Modell 86 · Grössenangabe 137 · Zustand 69 ·
        Defekt-Kategorie 109 · Chargen-Nummer 263 · Kommentar 103.
        Sizes below are the rem equivalents, so the skeleton stands roughly as
        tall as the form it is standing in for and the reveal barely shifts.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="aico-cognito-skeleton" data-aico-cognito-skeleton>
        <span class="aico-sr-only">{{ 'aico_forms.loading' | t }}</span>
        <div aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="aico-skeleton aico-skel-pulse aico-cognito-skel-title"></div>
          {%- if skeleton_intro -%}
            <div class="aico-skeleton aico-skel-pulse aico-cognito-skel-intro"></div>
          {%- endif -%}
          <div class="aico-skeleton aico-skel-pulse aico-cognito-skel-readout"></div>

          <div class="aico-cognito-skel-duo">
            <div class="aico-skeleton aico-skel-pulse aico-cognito-skel-field"></div>
            <div class="aico-skeleton aico-skel-pulse aico-cognito-skel-field"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="aico-skeleton aico-skel-pulse aico-cognito-skel-field"></div>

          <div class="aico-skeleton aico-skel-pulse aico-cognito-skel-choice-s"></div>
          <div class="aico-skeleton aico-skel-pulse aico-cognito-skel-choice-m"></div>
          <div class="aico-skeleton aico-skel-pulse aico-cognito-skel-choice-l"></div>
          <div class="aico-skeleton aico-skel-pulse aico-cognito-skel-choice-s"></div>
          <div class="aico-skeleton aico-skel-pulse aico-cognito-skel-choice-xl"></div>

          <div class="aico-skeleton aico-skel-pulse aico-cognito-skel-batch"></div>
          <div class="aico-skeleton aico-skel-pulse aico-cognito-skel-comment"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="aico-cognito-mount" data-aico-cognito-mount>
        <script src="https://www.cognitoforms.com/f/seamless.js" data-key="{{ settings.aico_cognito_form_key }}" data-form="{{ form_id }}"></script>
        <script>
          Cognito.prefill({
            "CustomerNumber": {{ customer.aico_customer_number | json }},
            "Kundenreferenznummerselectline": {{ customer.aico_customer_reference_number | default: '' | json }},
            "Kundenreferenznummer2myfactory": {{ customer.aico_second_customer_reference_number | default: '' | json }},
            "Land": {{ customer.aico_country | default: '' | json }},
            "Market": {{ customer.aico_debtor.seller_name | default: '' | json }}
          });
        </script>
      </div>
    </div>
  {%- else -%}
    <p class="aico-cognito-form-unavailable">{{ 'aico_forms.unavailable' | t }}</p>
  {%- endif -%}
</main>

<script src="{{ 'aico-cognito-form.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
